data/

# LICENCE RULE (derived models): the licence forbids releasing models or statistics
# derived from the corpus without the licensor's approval. A LoRA adapter trained on
# learner transcripts IS such a derivative — weights stay local. Adapters belong in
# data/derived/adapters/ (already covered above); these are belt-and-braces for any
# tool that defaults to writing weights at the repo root.
adapters/
adapter_config.json
*.safetensors
*.npz
*.gguf

